{"seq":48,"slug":"time-series-forecasting","title":"时间序列预测","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 时间序列预测\n\n时间序列预测是从历史观测数据中学习时间依赖结构，进而对未来值做出有概率意义的推断。它既是统计学的经典分支，也是 2024-2026 年基础模型革命中变化最剧烈的方向之一——TimesFM 2.5、Chronos-2、Moirai-2.0 等预训练模型使零样本预测成为生产级选项，而 PatchTST、N-BEATS、N-HiTS 等任务特化架构在特定场景下仍具竞争力。\n\n## 本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工\n\n本 hub 专注于「预测」——给定历史序列，产出未来点估计或概率分布。与同 category 下的相关 hub 划分如下：\n\n- **AB 测试与统计推断**（`5_ab-testing-statistics`）：解决「两组差异是否显著」的检验问题，其中样本量计算和序贯检验与时序预测共用底层统计工具，但目标不同。\n- **推荐算法**（`47_recommendation-algorithms`）：序列推荐（Sequential Recommendation）中用到时序建模技巧，但其核心目标是排序/召回而非未来值预测。\n- **概率图模型 / 贝叶斯推断**：提供先验知识注入的理论框架，本 hub 在基础章节引用其概率建模思想。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n**路径 A：全栈工程师（3-7 年经验）**\n\n1. 基础 → 统计模型 → 评估指标 → N-BEATS/N-HiTS → PatchTST/Transformer → 基础模型 → 特征工程 → 管道架构 → 在线服务\n2. 先建立经典方法直觉，再理解深度学习如何超越，最后掌握工程落地。\n\n**路径 B：算法研究者**\n\n1. 基础 → 评估指标 → N-BEATS/N-HiTS → PatchTST/Transformer → 基础模型 → 金融时序/异常检测\n2. 侧重模型架构演进和前沿进展。\n\n**路径 C：业务分析师 / 数据科学新手**\n\n1. 基础 → 统计模型 → 需求预测 → 评估指标\n2. 快速上手可落地方法，理解业务指标。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 线性代数基础（矩阵运算、特征值）\n- 概率论与统计推断（条件概率、极大似然、假设检验）\n- Python 编程（NumPy / Pandas / PyTorch 任一深度学习框架）\n- 了解 Transformer 注意力机制（对深度学习章节有帮助，但非硬性要求）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-series-decomposition","title":"时间序列分解与平稳性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/time-series-decomposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"statistical-models","title":"经典统计预测模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/statistical-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"预测评估指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/foundations/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-learning","title":"深度学习方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/machine-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nbeats-nhits","title":"N-BEATS 与 N-HiTS 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/machine-learning/nbeats-nhits"},{"seq":2,"slug":"patchtst-transformer","title":"PatchTST 与 Transformer 时序架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/machine-learning/patchtst-transformer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"foundation-models","title":"时间序列基础模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/machine-learning/foundation-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"时序特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/feature-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-architecture","title":"预测管道架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/pipeline-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"online-serving","title":"在线预测服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/online-serving"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/demand-forecasting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"financial-forecasting","title":"金融时序预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/financial-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/applications/anomaly-detection"}]}]}